# Every text file checks out LF on every platform. Scripts run in bash on Linux
# and WSL, where a CRLF shebang fails; Windows editors and tooling read LF fine.
# eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf on Windows checkouts. For a file that must stay
# CRLF, add a line such as `*.bat text eol=crlf` beneath this one.
* text=auto eol=lf
